menu "S3Wear board (bsp_s3w)"

    config S3W_LCD_PCLK_MHZ
        int "AMOLED QSPI clock (MHz)"
        range 10 80
        default 40
        help
            CO5300 QSPI clock. 40 MHz is the vendor default (~21 ms per full frame).
            80 MHz halves transfer time; keep 40 if artifacts appear (docs/01-hardware.md §5).

endmenu
